//――けれどたった一つの間違いで災いの化身
//になりおおせる》
《Didn't you learn anything from Grandfather's failure!? We were forged to strip our masters of self-<br>righteousness, but a single mistake, and we become doom for untold millions.》

//【村正】
<voice name='村正' class='村正さん' src='voice/md01/016vs0480a01'>
