"Our hearts are forged of mighty steel, and therefore our will is eternal and unchanging... but minds of flesh, it seems, are incapable of retaining truth even after it is㉓<I>branded</I>㉒into them."

pt:
//【二世村正】
<voice name='二世村正' class='二世村正' src='voice/md01/016vs0740a15'>
